          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Agreement), and (iii)&#160;the HKSE clearance and the approval from the HKSE in respect of the Practice Note 15 of the HKSE Listing Rules with respect to the transactions shall have been obtained and remain effective. </font>
        </div>
