          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">The conditions for the closing of the transactions under the Divestiture Agreement (pursuant to the terms of the Divestiture Agreement) (the &#8220;</font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Divestiture Closing</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8221;) shall have been satisfied or waived, and the Divestiture Closing shall have occurred immediately prior to the Closing. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:20pt; line-height:12pt; margin-top:6.2pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; width:10pt;white-space:nowrap;">
