          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">subject to the first bullet above, enter into or amend any agreement with, or pay, distribute or advance any assets or property to, any of its officers, directors, shareholders or other affiliates (other than GEHI Group Companies), other than (i)&#160;payments or distributions relating to obligations in respect of arm&#8217;s-length commercial transactions, (ii)&#160;reimbursement for reasonable expenses incurred in connection with any of the GEHI Group Companies, (iii)&#160;GEHI Share Plans, (iv)&#160;employment arrangements entered into in the ordinary course and (v)&#160;pursuant to the permitted distributions; </font>
