          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:5.9pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:justify; margin-left:30pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">From the date of the Merger Agreement until the Closing, Best Assistant shall use commercially reasonable efforts to promptly obtain from Deloitte Touche Tohmatsu Limited (including its affiliates,&#160;&#8220;</font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Deloitte</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8221;) (or such other auditor to the reasonable satisfaction of the Company, or as required by the SEC, the NYSE and/or the HKSE, as applicable) such financial statements of the </font>
        </div>
