          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">The memorandum and articles of association of the Company shall have been amended and restated in its entirety in the form of the A&amp;R MAA and the conversion of its ListCo Class&#160;B Ordinary Shares to ListCo Class&#160;A Ordinary Shares by each holder of ListCo Class&#160;B Ordinary Shares shall have occurred in connection therewith. </font>
