          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Best Assistant shall have delivered to the Company a certificate, signed by a duly authorized officer of Best Assistant and dated as of the applicable Closing Date, certifying as to the matters set forth in the five bullets above. </font>
        </div>
