          <font style="letter-spacing:0.16pt;">For each person and group included in this column, percentage of voting power is calculated by dividing the voting power beneficially owned by such person or group by the voting power of all of our Class&#160;A and Class&#160;B ordinary shares as a single class. Each holder of ListCo Class&#160;A Ordinary Shares is entitled to one vote per share and each holder of our ListCo Class&#160;B Ordinary Shares is entitled to ten votes per share on all matters submitted to them for a vote. Our ListCo Class&#160;A Ordinary Shares and ListCo Class&#160;B Ordinary Shares vote together as a single class on all matters submitted to a vote of our shareholders, except as may otherwise be required by law. Our ListCo Class&#160;B Ordinary Shares are convertible at any time by the holder thereof into ListCo Class&#160;A Ordinary Shares on a one-for-one basis.</font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
