        </div>
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; text-align:justify; width:456pt; line-height:11.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">(b)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;in the case of the GEHI Parties, the representations and warranties contained in </font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Section&#160;5.1</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> (Organization and Qualification) (other than </font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Section&#160;5.1(c)</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">); the second sentence of </font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Section&#160;5.2(a)</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> (GEHI Subsidiaries); </font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Sections&#160;5.2(e)</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> (GEHI Subsidiaries); </font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Section&#160;5.3</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> (Capitalization) (other than </font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Section&#160;5.3(h)</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">); </font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Section&#160;5.4</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> (Authority Relative to this Agreement); </font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Section&#160;5.5(a)(i)</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> (No Conflict; Required Filings and Consents) and </font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Section&#160;5.14</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> (Brokers). </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-left:20pt; margin-top:8pt; text-align:justify; width:436pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8220;</font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">GEHI</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8221; shall have the meaning set forth in the Preamble hereto. </font>
