          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Skadden, Arps, Slate, Meagher &amp; Flom LLP </font> <br ><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">46th Floor, Tower II</font> <br ><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Jing An Kerry Center</font> <br ><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">1539 Nanjing West Road</font> <br ><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Shanghai 200040, the PRC</font> <br ><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Attention: Yuting Wu, Esq.</font> <br ><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Email: Yuting.Wu@skadden.com </font></div>
