        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; text-align:justify; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">I/We,&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;, being the registered holder of &#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199; ordinary shares</font><font style=" position:relative; bottom:4.25pt;font-size:7.5pt;letter-spacing:0.15pt;">(Note 1)</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> par value US$0.001 per share, of Gravitas Education Holdings, Inc. (the &#8220;</font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Company</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8221;) hereby appoint the Chairman of the Extraordinary General Meeting</font><font style=" position:relative; bottom:4.25pt;font-size:7.5pt;letter-spacing:0.15pt;">(Note 2)</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> or &#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199;&#8199; as my/our proxy to attend and act for me/us at the Extraordinary General Meeting (or at any adjournment thereof) of the Company (the &#8220;</font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Meeting</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8221;) to be held on September&#160;11, 2023 at 10:00&#160;a.m. Beijing time, at 3/F, No. 28 Building, Fangguyuan Section&#160;1, Fangzhuang, Fengtai District, Beijing, People&#8217;s Republic of China, and at any adjournment(s) thereof, and in the event of a poll, to vote for me/us as indicated below, or if no such indication is given, as my/our proxy thinks fit. </font>
        </div>
