      <div style="margin-top:6pt;margin-bottom:492pt;margin-left:69.66pt;width:456pt;">
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; text-align:justify; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">The information contained herein with respect to the Meeting has been provided by the Company. Citibank, N.A. is forward-ing this information to you solely as Depositary and in accordance with the terms of the Deposit Agreement and disclaims any respon-sibility with respect to the accuracy of such information. The rights and obligations of Holders and Beneficial Owners of ADSs, the Company and the Depositary are set forth in their entirety in the Deposit Agreement and summarized in the American Depositary Receipts. If you wish to receive a copy of the Deposit Agreement, please contact the Depositary at the number set forth below. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; text-align:justify; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:-0.2pt;">If you have any questions, please contact Citibank, N.A.&#8201;&#8212;&#8201;ADR Shareholder Services at 1-877-CITI-ADR (1-877-248-4237).</font><font style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-left:240pt; margin-top:8pt; text-align:justify; width:216pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Citibank, N.A., as Depositary </font>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:0pt;height:12pt;margin-left:69.66pt;width:456pt;">
        <div style="margin-top:5pt; text-align:center; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#160;</font>
          <br >
        </div>
